WEBVTT

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:51.360
Here's a gift for you.

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:53.230
Thank you very much.

00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:56.250
It's a rare, old vintage alcohol.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:57.820
I'm sure it tastes good.

00:01:57.820 --> 00:01:59.570
We'll enjoy it right away.

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:05.410
Yeah, it smells great.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.460
Well, you should join us.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:12.210
I'll pass.  I'm still on duty.

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:15.010
In that case, don't mind us.

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:20.470
It's great!

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:38.060
By the way, regarding Touda eggs,

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:39.040
how are they?

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:43.830
We're doing our best, but they're proving to be difficult to obtain.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:48.540
After all, even Touda breeders have a hard time getting a hold of them.

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:50.790
That's why I have you guys, right?

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:56.040
Well, that's all right.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:03:01.300
I think it's about time I stop working with you back-street merchants.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:03.550
What do you mean by that?!

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:05.350
You're saying the deal's off?!

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:08.170
The Sezans are now in motion.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:09.710
S-Sezans?

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:12.740
The Queen's royal guards are...

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:15.270
Even so, we can't have you back out on us!

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:27.760
You poisoned the drink...

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.290
I said it's time I end it, right?

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:35.090
You... Saigamul...

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:41.790
Oh, dear.  You should never speak of Wajyaku in my presence.

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:22.570
Light in the Sky

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:26.800
Is that true?

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:30.140
Yes.  I heard it at the Lazal Beast-Lord Care Center.

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:35.440
They were saying that Kazalm raises beast-lords with measures not in accordance to the Beast-Lord Imperatives.

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:43.360
Erin's name was not included in the rumor, but I think the information will eventually make it to the capital.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:45.910
I see.

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:49.610
From the story you're telling, the capital may already know of it.

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:53.580
It has been four years since Erin had come to Kazalm,

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:58.380
and she is now a college student.

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.180
Behave yourself!

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:07.320
Come on, you're a beauty, but you'll ruin it if you don't fix your bed hair.

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:10.830
There now, that's a good girl.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.600
That's quite impressive.

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:16.500
The rumor proves true.

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:19.400
You don't use the mute whistle.

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:26.820
Excuse me, but who are you?

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:42.670
While you were at Lazal for your training, we accepted a teacher from Tamuyuan.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:44.350
A teacher?

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:45.970
At this time of the year?

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:48.050
He came accompanied by a large donation amount.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:58.070
From Kazalm's point of view, it's a great addition to the diminishing budget and the amount of teachers, but...

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:02.610
Pardon me.  I've escorted a guest over.

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:04.320
Come in.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:11.030
I'm Kiriku, the newly-appointed teacher.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:18.250
There are many nobles and politicians at Tamuyuan, right?

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:23.500
Yeah.  And he happens to be a son of a noble who's familiar with Tamuyuan.

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:26.460
I see.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:30.850
What's so funny?

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:34.440
You never used to bring up something like that as a topic.

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:36.960
I'm already 18, you know?

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.230
I know.

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:45.190
Tomura-senpai, when I get out of class, let me hear what the beast-lords at Lazal were like.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:52.380
She's still beast-lord gung-ho, even after becoming a college student, huh?

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:13.480
Everyone, nice to meet you.

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:17.430
I will teach you everything about poisons.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:20.450
My gosh!  He's such a good-looking hottie.

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:22.730
He's a specialist in poisons, I've heard.

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:32.140
Plants have thorns and poisons to protect themselves.

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:34.570
What plant develops poison in this season?

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.880
You there, with the green eyes.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.080
Yes.

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.270
It's ukigomori.

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:47.540
The root saturates with poison, and if you eat it, you feel nauseous, throw up, and have diarrhea.

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:49.080
Correct.

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:51.090
Here's your reward.

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:58.220
It's a candy.

00:07:58.670 --> 00:07:59.680
Here.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.570
You can have one, too.

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:13.150
But, you shouldn't only be staring at me.

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:16.110
I-I'll be careful.

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:26.500
What should you do if a horse or a goat ingests a poison by mistake?

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:28.250
You there.

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:34.980
You boil a dried bitter weed together with atsune weed, and let them drink the concoction.

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:36.300
Correct.

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:38.470
Thank you very much.

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.970
You hit me with one first!

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:52.720
We're having our graduation trial in only half a year.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.900
You're going to stay here right, Erin?

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:58.870
Yeah.  I want to become a teacher like Tomura-senpai is doing.

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:01.470
You'll return to your home, right?

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:04.250
Only if I pass the graduation trial.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.720
I'm so bad with the poisons class, right?

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:09.510
What should I do if I fail?

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:11.670
Just come to my place.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:15.670
Ka-Ka-Ka-Ka-

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:18.480
Kashugan!  What are you saying all of a sudden?!

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:21.090
Are you implying you-

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:24.650
We're short on beastinarians at my place.

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:33.160
Where I'm from is big into raising cows, but most beastinarians have become old and have since retired,

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:36.400
so we're frantic to find help.

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:42.160
Oh, so I'm just a helper.

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:47.870
Wow, look at all these.

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:51.830
Sorry to make a teacher do this.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:55.820
Well, the steamed freshwater fish dish at lunch was great.

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:57.970
So please consider this as a thanks for that.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:00.280
Oh my, that's too nice...

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:05.220
You and Erin are about the only people that actually come and say such nice things.

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:06.930
Erin?

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:09.170
She's a college student here.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:11.480
Helps out and studies hard.

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:16.190
Besides that, even Esal-sensei relies on her when it comes to beast-lords.

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:18.070
Really?

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:21.730
Excuse me.

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:24.280
I'm looking for a student named Erin.

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:27.290
What do you want with the little girl?

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:32.710
Karisa-san told me that you can't find a better student than her.

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:38.840
After being told that even Esal-sensei relies on her when it comes to beast-lords, of course I'd like to get to know her.

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:41.190
Oh, is that the deal?

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:42.070
Yeah.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:47.310
Yeah, when it comes to the little girl, beast-lords are like chirping little birds.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:49.350
That's amazing.

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:53.770
She must be used to handling other animals, too, then.

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:55.230
Of course she is!

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:58.870
Horses, goats, and...

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.990
Was there anything else?

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:02.610
Touda, as well.

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:04.370
Touda?

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:10.350
Ah, right.  That's where she was born, after all.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:11.980
That's right.

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:14.790
That was supposed to be a secret!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.500
You're the one who spilled the beans.

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:22.300
Calm down.  I won't tell anyone.

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:28.310
Here.  Why not eat these and make up?

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:31.200
Hey, those are kusamochi!

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:33.580
That's our favorite food!

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.510
That's great.

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:38.780
By the way, what we were talking about earlier...

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:02.670
So you were Erin.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:05.940
"Wild apple."

00:12:05.940 --> 00:12:08.430
It's a name very fitting for you.

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:15.140
On the branch of a wild apple tree, apples will always grow in pairs.

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:19.190
It's as if it describes you and that beast-lord.

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:37.540
How can you touch the beast-lord without using a mute whistle?

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:47.030
You must be amazing.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:50.240
Why are you asking me this?

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:55.770
Don't you think it's amazing that a beast-lord is so close to a human, when they don't befriend humans?

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:01.690
Kiriku-sensei.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:04.150
You are?

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:07.350
Student Teacher, Tomura.

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:09.160
Esal-sensei is looking for you.

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:10.790
Oh boy.

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:12.290
How busy.

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:19.470
I heard you're asking around about Erin among the students.

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:22.090
Yes, the Mist People are new to my life.

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:28.130
I told you to pay no mind to her eye color and background.

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:34.630
Also to keep everything I saw and heard here to myself, right?

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:37.100
Of course I'm aware of that.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:44.070
Besides, if I get kicked out of here, I don't have a place to go.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:49.820
I came to Kazalm to prepare to die.

00:14:06.350 --> 00:14:09.650
When snow started to come down heavily,

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:13.530
the long-awaited winter break came.

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:20.340
When the students who spend their time at home left,

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:25.500
the always-noisy campus became occupied with silence.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:34.390
All done.

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:40.160
Do you want to go outside?

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:43.660
I did finish cleaning earlier than I thought, so why not?

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:04.230
I envy you, Lilan.  You're covered in down, so you must be warm.

00:15:05.980 --> 00:15:11.740
You know, I want to research the difference between wild and hand-raised beast-lords.

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:15.450
I guess you wouldn't understand.

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:25.380
Look at all those birds.

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:32.840
Do you want to go there?

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.290
A beast-lord and a human, eh?

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.850
When a human and another human can't even understand each other,

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:33.650
how could a human and a beast?

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:37.290
Tahya!  Tahya!

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:44.130
I was ready for this to come any day now, Onii-sama.

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:47.080
I wish you the best, Onii-sama.

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:52.270
Tahya!  Tahya!

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:02.790
Do you understand under whose care you're living?

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:05.500
You have to understand that you're a bird in a cage.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.960
You're just a pet, Holon.

00:17:13.820 --> 00:17:18.450
My sister died due to your greed.

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:23.870
Greedy Wajyaku should perish from this world.

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:29.830
Seimiya-sama.

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:32.410
You have a gift from Shunan-sama.

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:34.340
My, from Shunan?

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:36.630
My dear Seimiya.

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:38.550
How are you today?

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:39.940
Uncle!

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:43.010
I brought something fitting for you.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.570
What did you bring with you?

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:50.760
Something much better than the flowers that you often get from someone.

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:59.910
Pick it up and take a look at it.

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:02.950
Uncle, what is this?

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:05.700
Can you guess what it is?

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:14.130
This is the palace!

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:15.990
Right, Uncle?

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.520
You're trying to please me with a toy like this?

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:25.100
You treat me like a child no matter how old I get.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:28.060
That's not true, Seimiya.

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:30.790
To view the world from above.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:35.320
It's an adult form of entertainment, since only grown-ups can understand the pleasure.

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:47.520
Don't go too far away.

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:49.750
It's so cold.

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:59.090
Lilan!

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:07.060
Lilan...

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.230
Lilan, don't move!

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:23.160
Lilan, stay still!

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:33.420
Lilan!

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:40.380
Lilan!!

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:07.990
The sky?

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:19.670
Are we flying?

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.720
What is this?

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:50.480
A beast-lord... is flying with a person on its back?

00:21:14.550 --> 00:21:15.680
Tahya...

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:12.020
With her great white wings spread,

00:22:12.020 --> 00:22:13.990
Lilan flew in the big sky.

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:21.950
She was shimmering very beautifully.

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:06.800
Beyond Ephon Noha, there once was a
country called Ophalon.

00:24:07.660 --> 00:24:13.950
Why did this Touda-using kingdom that was at its zenith of prosperity perish?

00:24:13.950 --> 00:24:16.540
I must tell the story to you,

00:24:16.540 --> 00:24:18.710
Soyon's daughter, Erin,

00:24:19.150 --> 00:24:21.920
before you commit a crime.

00:24:21.920 --> 00:24:23.550
Kemono no Souja Erin.

00:24:23.550 --> 00:24:25.010
A Crime.

00:24:25.010 --> 00:26:00.030
A Crime
